Package: kactivitymanagerd
Version: @DEB_KACTIVITYMANAGERD_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://kde.org/
Depends: qt6-base, kf6-config, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-crash, kf6-dbusaddons, kf6-globalaccel, kf6-i18n, kf6-kio, kf6-service, kf6-windowsystem, kf6-xmlgui, plasma-activities, plasma-activities-stats
Description: Plasma activity manager daemon for Xios
 kactivitymanagerd provides the org.kde.ActivityManager DBus service used by
 plasmashell to load activities, containments, and resource scoring state.
 .
 Part of the KDE Plasma Desktop and Plasma Mobile support layer for Xios.
